---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /press-kit/
active: press
bodyClass: on-paper
title: Press kit
description: "Biographies at three lengths, photographs, and the curriculum vitae for Adán Fernández — ready for programs, posters and listings."
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Press kit</p>
    <h1>Everything a program needs.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Copy any of these straight into a concert program, a poster, or a listing. No permission needed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Name &amp; billing</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="stack" style="max-width:70ch">
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Full</span><div>{{ site.name }}</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Short</span><div>{{ site.shortName }}</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Billing</span><div>Dr. Adán Alejándro Fernández, organist</div></div>
      <div class="entry reveal"><span class="yr">Roles</span><div>{{ site.roles }}</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Biography, one line</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-bottom:3rem">{{ bio.oneLine }}</p>

    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Biography, short</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="prose reveal" style="margin-bottom:3rem"><p>{{ bio.short }}</p></div>

    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Biography, full</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="prose reveal">
      {%- for p in bio.long %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Photographs</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">{{ site.photoCredit }} Please carry the credit wherever they appear.</p>
    <div class="photo-grid">
    {%- for p in photos.items %}
      <figure class="photo reveal">
        <a href="{{ p.file }}" download><img src="{{ p.web }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" width="{{ p.ww }}" height="{{ p.wh }}" loading="lazy"></a>
        <figcaption><span>{{ p.alt }}</span><span class="fine">{{ p.shape }} &middot; {{ p.w }} &times; {{ p.h }}</span><a class="dl" href="{{ p.file }}" download>Download</a></figcaption>
      </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rule-head reveal"><span class="lbl">Documents &amp; links</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card reveal" href="{{ site.cv }}" download><h3>Curriculum vitae</h3><p>Full education, positions, performance history, publications and compositions.</p><span class="go">Download PDF &rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="card reveal" href="{{ site.youtube }}" rel="noopener"><h3>Recordings</h3><p>Organ, harpsichord, conducting and lectures, on his YouTube channel.</p><span class="go">Open the channel &rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="card reveal" href="{{ site.management.url }}" rel="noopener"><h3>Artist management</h3><p>{{ site.management.name }}.</p><span class="go">Management page &rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
